<h2>What you need</h2>

<row>
  <col>
    <h3>Flour</h3>

    <p>500 g, bread flour if you can.</p>
  </col>
  <col>
    <h3>Water</h3>

    <p>375 g, lukewarm.</p>
  </col>
  <col>
    <h3>Starter</h3>

    <p>100 g, bubbly and fed 6 hours ago.</p>
  </col>
</row>

<row>
  <col>
    <h3>Salt</h3>

    <p>10 g.</p>
  </col>
  <col>
    <h3>A pot</h3>

    <p>A heavy lidded pot that goes in the oven.</p>
  </col>
  <col>
    <h3>Patience</h3>

    <p>Most of the work is waiting.</p>
  </col>
</row>
